dinary third-party custom geometry projects truthfully as shape or opaque content and is never inferred back into an icon name. | PPJ resolves an exact bundled Font Awesome Free name to one finite editable DrawingML custom path. Unknown names, arbitrary SVG paths, external icon providers and semantic inference from native geometry fail closed. |\n| independently rotated connector frames | `connector.frame` | `fail-closed` | Imported placement and transform topology remains source-preserved unless a matching typed capability is issued. | Shape, text, placeholder, image, chart, table and group frames own rotation/flips; connector orientation remains endpoint-derived. |\n| structured chart titles and other chart typography | `chart.title, chart.style.titleTextStyle, chart.style.legendTextStyle, chart.style.dataLabels.textStyle and chart axes textStyle/titleTextStyle` | `partial` | Bounded multi-paragraph/run chart titles are projected and editable through setChartTitle; canonical legend, data-label, axis-title and axis tick-label typography remains editable through setChartTextStyle. Unsupported title containers remain source-preserved. | Authored ordinary and combo charts own structured title runs plus Latin/East Asian typefaces, size, bold, italic and direct RGB/alpha. Formula-backed titles, hyperlinks, theme transforms, WordArt, shadows, effects and unknown title topology remain outside the bounded profile. |\n| third-party media playback graphs | `pages[].elements[] where type is media and nativeRef is present` | `source-bound-only` | Imported audio/video pictures, media relationships and timing graphs remain opaque-preserved unless a future capability proves the complete playback closure. | Source-free PPJ owns a bounded canonical audio/video profile with an explicit poster, trim, loop and mute. It does not claim arbitrary third-party triggers, bookmarks, media effects or timing topology. |\n| third-party partial element lock profiles | `pages[].elements[].locked`